-    side of blocks.
--   Added ``map``, ``select``, ``reject``, ``selectattr`` and
-    ``rejectattr`` filters.
--   Added support for ``loop.depth`` to figure out how deep inside a
-    recursive loop the code is.
--   Disabled py_compile for pypy and python 3.
